What how I met your mother means to me is that grief is temporary whether I've had a fantastic day or a terrible day watching that show is always the right move for the mood.
我如何认识你母亲对我来说意味着悲伤是暂时的，无论我度过了美好的一天还是糟糕的一天，观看该节目总是适合心情的举动。

00:00:12.183 --> 00:00:14.434
And there was this wonderful show.
于是就有了这场精彩的表演。

