General knowledge?
常识？

00:00:58.619 --> 00:01:06.140
But we'll also use him-yim and our relationship to it, these 20 years later, to talk about life and love and art and everything in between.
但二十年后，我们也会用他和我们之间的关系来谈论生活、爱情、艺术以及介于两者之间的一切。

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.540
And just like the show itself, this podcast doesn't exist without you.
就像节目本身一样，没有您就没有这个播客。

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.260
Your voices will be a big part of what we do.
您的声音将成为我们工作的重要组成部分。

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:22.260
I'm alone, and I won't be soon in New York City.
我独自一人，而且我不会很快到达纽约市。

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.299
Tell the people listening.
告诉正在听的人。

