But we have a section called questions and observations from a clinical psychologist, relationship expert, who's never seen how I met your mother, who also happens to be very Josh.
但是我们有一个叫做问题和观察的部分，来自一位临床心理学家、关系专家，他从来没有见过我是如何认识你母亲的，而她恰好也是一个非常乔希的人。

00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:41.606
Is that title too catchy?
这标题是不是太吸引人了？

00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:45.991
We are now embarking on this rewatch together, our her first watch rather.
我们现在正在一起重新观看，这是我们的第一部观看。

