And this old man, he must admit he fell in love with you in New York City.
而这个老人，他必须承认他在纽约爱上了你。

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:37.340
I'm excited to unpack this stuff, and it feels honestly, it feels like psychologically healthy for me to do this, you know, it feels like are you ready to go back to the Titanic?
我很高兴能打开这些东西，老实说，这样做对我来说心理上是健康的，你知道，感觉就像你准备好回到泰坦尼克号了吗？

